  "solution": "Given:\n\n42 (1)/(5) div[36+(2)/(3)right. of left.15-(24 div 8+(4)/(5))]\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/694d0d67bc14effd3a3679b70b4d77edef851107a6a53b64ea488e47e4c2bef5.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n42 (1)/(5) ÷[36+(2)/(3)right. of left.15-(24 ÷ 8+(4)/(5))]\n\n⇒ 42.2 ÷ [36 + 2/3 × 15 - (24 ÷ 8 + 0.8)]\n\n⇒ 42.2 ÷ [36 + 2/3 × 15 - (3 + 0.8)]\n\n⇒ 42.2 ÷ [36 + 10 - 3 - 0.8]\n\n⇒ 42.2 ÷ 42.2\n\n⇒ 1\n\n∴ The simplified value is 1.",
